16	 * members) - the key is therefore compared against every other owner's finalized key. Because the
17	 * telephone is part of the key, two household members with different telephones have different keys
18	 * and both are allowed; only an exact whole-key match is a duplicate. Throws
19	 * {@link DuplicateIdentityException} (handled as 409) on a collision.
